# system

`system` is the name of the singular instance of the `System` type.

`system` holds the `methodDictionary`:

```
>>> system
>>> .methodDictionary
>>> .size
7201

>>> system
>>> .methodDictionary
>>> .keys
>>> .includes('sum')
true
```

`system` holds the `traitDictionary`:

```
>>> system
>>> .traitDictionary
>>> .size
57

>>> system
>>> .traitDictionary
>>> .keys
>>> .includes('FiniteCollection')
true
```

`system` holds the `typeDictionary`:

```
>>> system
>>> .typeDictionary
>>> .size
268

>>> system
>>> .typeDictionary
>>> .keys
>>> .includes('List')
true
```

